  "title": "大白豆烧排骨|日日食，好时光",
  "summary": "最近，决定打起精神记录一点饮食生活日常。 记录日常能使我带有觉知。让我聚焦在琐碎而寻常的事物上，让我的思绪不至于四处飘散。 这些日常是我的锚点。 日常，弥足珍贵。 2026年5月1日大白豆烧排骨 这一日，吃的是 大白豆烧排骨，花椒鸭，丝瓜和四季豆。 花椒鸭我是买的成品，​​​​​​​​​​​​斩件热一下就可以吃。而大白豆烧排骨则实打实烧了两个小时。出锅时豆子已经烧软，口感沙沙的，排骨很软，我自己觉得少了糖，橘子和他的朋友老高觉得蛮好。 丝瓜里我加了牛肉丸切片，我总是能想出奇怪的搭配，味道也还可以。丝瓜做清淡口味总是没错的~ 四季豆是切段，加芽菜和剁辣椒炒的，要是有肉馅，加点进去会更美味，可惜这周我忘记买了。 2026年5月3日粉蒸肉 今日做了粉蒸肉。相对于湖南粉蒸肉那种用坛子腌一下的做法，我更喜欢将新鲜五花肉…",
  "content": "<h3><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>最近，决定打起精神记录一点饮食生活日常。</span></span></span></span><br></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>记录日常能使我带有觉知。让我聚焦在琐碎而寻常的事物上，让我的思绪不至于四处飘散。</span></span></span></span><br></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这些日常是我的锚点。</span></span></span></span><br></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日常，弥足珍贵。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3><h3><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2026年5月1日大白豆烧排骨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3><p><span></span></p><div><span><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgrTjJzhHVglodHRUGmyjeObEaHGdAzmnZW11-vXluIJ6c_y-qdxccNfFDK6vSdt_htie77kr-iv6y2d_aPrcsg1uScjC3_jDeMFu4PGdrKshX_rnlPnVhswBAlI_aPhfK-wWRDbypLNfajcRJeVjTMvSLyzuYrfH5nNyxbEdqkg4i162Ik-_dcxOiEF5wg/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260501160357_360_17.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"482\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgrTjJzhHVglodHRUGmyjeObEaHGdAzmnZW11-vXluIJ6c_y-qdxccNfFDK6vSdt_htie77kr-iv6y2d_aPrcsg1uScjC3_jDeMFu4PGdrKshX_rnlPnVhswBAlI_aPhfK-wWRDbypLNfajcRJeVjTMvSLyzuYrfH5nNyxbEdqkg4i162Ik-_dcxOiEF5wg/w640-h482/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260501160357_360_17.jpg\" width=\"640\"></a></span></div><div><span><br></span></div><div><span><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg48bYlpk8ya7bKND2XAyzuvEO9NBWjf8a8mEYcVj72oGYwD5lb584H4PY85HQ95BiQf5gsHjkibnqJ5YcBvqfi0NPca5qq25yjIAjSddLNnQQKVaIC1zT-8r1cjU1yXc-wNN9maQwsPJuNAq09h99pwJG1BeYzR85xN7CTDA9ossSKpGWl6hPdVlHZ-mVV/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260501160355_358_17.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"482\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg48bYlpk8ya7bKND2XAyzuvEO9NBWjf8a8mEYcVj72oGYwD5lb584H4PY85HQ95BiQf5gsHjkibnqJ5YcBvqfi0NPca5qq25yjIAjSddLNnQQKVaIC1zT-8r1cjU1yXc-wNN9maQwsPJuNAq09h99pwJG1BeYzR85xN7CTDA9ossSKpGWl6hPdVlHZ-mVV/w640-h482/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260501160355_358_17.jpg\" width=\"640\"></a></span></div><span><br><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhtu7kBBBmGCjEqhjZb6NV6skaYjZNhdCp5m6NleTGhHGM7CP6qll3lBlzEPsCs9qNwaAqypinI8h-ciwKt5PuBFq45JcA5fgCk0FKFIDk4Igp7iHpfH4HorAdDMjuBHTNmrtX2Kt3KhJRSyNNT1_CYj7QKmhCGEto0RLWLWjlB7PjtAWFKoUx2FKVo9_jH/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260501160356_359_17.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"482\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhtu7kBBBmGCjEqhjZb6NV6skaYjZNhdCp5m6NleTGhHGM7CP6qll3lBlzEPsCs9qNwaAqypinI8h-ciwKt5PuBFq45JcA5fgCk0FKFIDk4Igp7iHpfH4HorAdDMjuBHTNmrtX2Kt3KhJRSyNNT1_CYj7QKmhCGEto0RLWLWjlB7PjtAWFKoUx2FKVo9_jH/w640-h482/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260501160356_359_17.jpg\" width=\"640\"></a></div><div><br></div><span><br></span></span><p></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这一日，吃的是</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>大白豆烧排骨，花椒鸭，丝瓜和四季豆。</p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>花椒鸭我是买的成品，​​​​​​​​​​​​斩件热一下就可以吃。而大白豆烧排骨则实打实烧了两个小时。出锅时豆子已经烧软，口感沙沙的，排骨很软，我自己觉得少了糖，橘子和他的朋友老高觉得蛮好。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丝瓜里我加了牛肉丸切片，我总是能想出奇怪的搭配，味道也还可以。丝瓜做清淡口味总是没错的~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>四季豆是切段，加芽菜和剁辣椒炒的，要是有肉馅，加点进去会更美味，可惜这周我忘记买了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><h3><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2026年5月3日粉蒸肉</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3><div><span><span><span><span><span><span>今日做了粉蒸肉。相对于湖南粉蒸肉那种用坛子腌一下的做法，我更喜欢将新鲜五花肉切片，简单淋生抽老抽，裹米粉，然后上锅蒸的做法。</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这道菜，我从小就会做。属于我很早就已经掌握的菜品了。小时候能吃一次粉蒸肉，我会雀跃很久，因为父母做饭都很敷衍长期以面条和炒饭打发吃饭，我长期处于缺蛋白质渴望肉蛋奶的状态，所以那时，只要能做粉蒸肉吃，就已经算是过节的状态，我能满心欢喜吃下好多。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>如今，对于粉蒸肉的念想没有那么剧烈了，但依旧喜欢三五不时为自己和橘子做一次吃。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丝瓜我用白肉清烧一下，烧烧软，出锅后，加一勺剁辣椒在里面。这样菜肉都清淡，又有剁辣椒的微酸和咸鲜，一切都刚刚好。橘子很喜欢这种清淡的丝瓜做法，每次都吃得干干净净。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><div><span><span><span><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjr2TBgpa1zyoHMuaEHNwrnbCdn8hk0qFKGZ4-HWvPmZ4aUr1GBCOwutl0g1ORBV5zET4_MDeCU00z5CjUJ9ZA3uUraxre6fiYdAoTOT8UcHQiC9WUBx3nOrTOrcVG47At2qV1bj-bjao8Rzrb_shfo1hjAg4FSlSsB6wNrtaRkg1THAPfrfYZQIgMwOI6W/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260503144859_363_17.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"482\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjr2TBgpa1zyoHMuaEHNwrnbCdn8hk0qFKGZ4-HWvPmZ4aUr1GBCOwutl0g1ORBV5zET4_MDeCU00z5CjUJ9ZA3uUraxre6fiYdAoTOT8UcHQiC9WUBx3nOrTOrcVG47At2qV1bj-bjao8Rzrb_shfo1hjAg4FSlSsB6wNrtaRkg1THAPfrfYZQIgMwOI6W/w640-h482/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260503144859_363_17.jpg\" width=\"640\"></a></span></span></span></div><span><span><span><br><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh-tjJsXesmwHdDUyM2KibBKWlgb60eoIuxmvak-9dnPvptqMLp1O3nl0NMuc8_GHMOlDl-RhGeTk_8LBLtj3dMwJCF91hE1Er6C28Mc0vNIQrbxMsGac95JOI03Adib-79wL4v-04bwBOJG0ZsEmsTBIA4HtFsVfgzljBCZBqFLEF2AJexM0RzT4eeB1GC/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260503144857_361_17.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"482\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh-tjJsXesmwHdDUyM2KibBKWlgb60eoIuxmvak-9dnPvptqMLp1O3nl0NMuc8_GHMOlDl-RhGeTk_8LBLtj3dMwJCF91hE1Er6C28Mc0vNIQrbxMsGac95JOI03Adib-79wL4v-04bwBOJG0ZsEmsTBIA4HtFsVfgzljBCZBqFLEF2AJexM0RzT4eeB1GC/w640-h482/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260503144857_361_17.jpg\" width=\"640\"></a></div><div><br></div><br><span><br></span></span></span></span><p></p><div><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></div><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>",
